OL,3,GNEWSANavy veterans compare Normandy
OL,4,Ainvasion stories
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It was absolutely lovely - Henry
OL,7,Fwalked in, with his walking stick,
OL,8,Fshouting out, 'Stand by your beds' and
OL,9,Fthe men shook hands for about five
OL,10,Fminutes," he said.
